<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 68-3 AT LUNCH IN 2ND TEST V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 68-3 AT LUNCH IN 2ND TEST V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 68 for three at lunch on the first day of the second test against Pakistan on Thursday.</p>
</text>
